{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/common_2020_denki_020.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/common_2020_denki_020.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_01",
      "hash64": "07B49E6934A10756",
      "text": "正在观看奇树奇述直播的各位！\\n早中晚上好哈啰！我是奇树！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_02",
      "hash64": "07B49D6934A105A3",
      "text": "今天我请到的嘉宾是\\n刚刚成为新冠军的[VAR 0x0100(0000)]～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_03",
      "hash64": "07B49C6934A103F0",
      "text": "话说[VAR 0x0100(0000)]啊，在馆主圈儿里\\n你也是个大红人，大家都爱谈论你哦～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_04",
      "hash64": "07B4A36934A10FD5",
      "text": "现在想来，你在道馆测验时的表现\\n也是让人麻得很刺激呢～[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_05",
      "hash64": "07B4A26934A10E22",
      "text": "这视频能有多火，点击量能有多高，\\n接下来实在是太让人期待了～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_06",
      "hash64": "07B4A16934A10C6F",
      "text": "那奇好～镜头拉到这个距离\\n就差不多了……[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_07",
      "hash64": "07B4A06934A10ABC",
      "text": "大伙等待已久的对战！\\n差不多该开始了！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_08",
      "hash64": "07B4A76934A116A1",
      "text": "我道馆馆主奇树！\\n难得一见地动了真格！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_09",
      "hash64": "07B4A66934A114EE",
      "text": "哎呀呀，输掉对战让我确实\\n也觉得很不甘心，不过呢……[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_10",
      "hash64": "07B11969349DEF80",
      "text": "本期奇树奇述直播的\\n观看人数实现了飙升！\\r\\n啊～太幸福了！升天的感觉～！！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_11",
      "hash64": "07B11A69349DF133",
      "text": "红人吸引人关注的力量\\n就是不一样啊～！！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_12",
      "hash64": "07B11B69349DF2E6",
      "text": "以后我们也要定期合演哦！\\n另外，不要上其他直播主的视频！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_13",
      "hash64": "07B11C69349DF499",
      "text": "那奇好～替我向首席问好！\\n报告时多为我说几句好话哦～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_134",
      "hash64": "AFE7F3C46866C1F7",
      "text": "用电网捕获大家的眼球！\\n谁带来的奇述？奇树带来的～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
